# Her Answer
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
I have read every version of the formula.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
And?
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
I want to try. Not because you promised. Because I want a life after this.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
Tell me what you need.
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
The truth, someone beside me, and the right to change my mind.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
You place the final page in front of her. She signs her own name.
